            "subtitle": "If something is missing, write us — we read everything.",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "faq_1_question": "What is ENSŌ Diamond?",
            "faq_1_answer": "Diamond is an electronic heating element that replaces charcoal on a traditional\nshisha. It sits on top of your setup, holds your set temperature, and runs ~90\nminutes on a single battery.",
