            "faq_2_answer": "Yes. Diamond is designed to drop in on any hookah setups.",
            "faq_3_question": "How does it replace charcoal?",
            "faq_3_answer": "You pack the cup as you usually would, without foil or coals. Diamond goes on\ntop of the traditional shisha, heats the tobacco from above and sides with a\nprecise ceramic element, and you start drawing. No CO, no smoke from coals —\njust steady heat tuned to your tobacco.",
